<Text-field style="Text" layout="Title" alignment="left"><Font encoding="UTF-8">Consider a 2\303\2272 </Font><Font italic="true">nonnegative</Font> matrix A=<Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation><Font encoding="UTF-8"> .Suppose the leading e-value  \316\273 &gt; 0  and second e-value \317\204</Font> are given, with </Text-field>
</Input>
